{
  "bio": [
    "Robert Coyiuto Jr. is the chairman of privately held Prudential Guarantee and Assurance, one of the largest non-life insurance companies in the Philippines.",
    "The company was founded by his late father Robert Sr., who was the first Filipino to become an underwriter of Lloyd's of London, a world-leading insurance market.",
    "He also owns a stake in privately held National Grid and listed Oriental Petroleum &amp; Minerals."
  ],
  "about": [
    "He founded PGA Cars in 1996, which is the sole distributor of Audi, Porsche, Lamborghini and Bentley in the Philippines.",
    "His Coyiuto Foundation set up a biennial award in 2014 for authors of biographies and autobiographies.",
    "In 2021, Coyiuto increased his holding in listed Synergy Grid following a share swap with his investment firm Pacifica21."
  ]
}